# wallpaper baseline — the wallpaper "emitter" is a resolver, not a
# file emit. This template documents the resolver's inputs so it lives
# alongside the other 18 baselines and shows up in the same wave.
#
# Resolver signature:
#   ResolveWallpaper(t *Theme, override string) (absolute path, error)
#
# Layered lookup:
#   1. If `override` is non-empty and exists on disk, use it.
#   2. If state.json records a per-theme wallpaper for t.Name, use that.
#   3. Else t.Wallpapers.Default (resolved against t.Dir/backgrounds/).
#   4. Else first file listed in t.Wallpapers.List.
#   5. Else first .jpg/.png in t.Dir/backgrounds/.
#
# The Go wallpaper hook calls the resolver at swap time. See
# docs/plans/theme-switcher-v4.md phase P3.
